WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.294 --> 00:00:04.838
Reporter:
Sixteen-year-old Warren Cave
was taken into custody...

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.174
Reporter:
The sixteen-year-old boy will be
tried as an adult.

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:10.135
Aaron Paul:
Warren was sentenced to life in
prison for 

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:12.971
murdering his neighbor at
sixteen years old.

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:16.725
Aaron Paul:
And he has now spent nineteen
years of that sentence.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:21.438
(Music)

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:27.194
When you first meet Warren as
this young, shy, strange little
kid,

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:30.197
and now he's a much more
hardened man.

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:34.826
Lauren Neustadter:
Warren is a very, very
complicated character.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:38.997
He adopted some beliefs that
were not his own, and he became

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:42.209
Lauren Neustadter:
someone other than the person
that his family knew him to be.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:46.171
This is the only family you got.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.300
Octavia Spencer:
Poppy Parnell is an
investigative journalist

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.844
Octavia Spencer:
who helped to send Warren Cave
to prison.

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:56.848
And it's a very uncomfortable
position for her to be in.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:01:01.019
She is believing maybe she's
wrong and maybe Warren was
innocent.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:05.232
Aaron Paul:
So she is possibly the one and
only person that will try to 

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:08.026
Aaron Paul:
make the truth reach the
surface.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:11.446
You are stepping in something
you have no business being
around.

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.741
Nichelle Spellman:
Everybody's lives stopped in one
way or the other

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:15.742
Nichelle Spellman:
the night of that murder.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.120
And their existing as the
walking wounded.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.038
You left us.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.541
Owen, you took everything from
me and Warren.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:25.335
You stole nineteen years of my
life!

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:26.545
Nineteen years!

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:31.758
Kristen Campo:
Melanie is dying of cancer, and
she feels helpless

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.053
that she can't help her son and
she only has so much time
to live.

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:40.309
There is this ticking clock to
get out and spend the last
moments with her.

00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:45.063
Melanie is a mother who will
not stop until she sees justice
for her son.

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:47.983
Judge:
There's not enough evidence to
constitute a new trial.

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.526
Judge:
-Motion denied.
(Gavel bangs)

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:50.527
My son is innocent.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.280
Owen believes his son's guilty.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.698
Brett Cullen:
And doesn't forgive him.
 

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:59.786
Aaron Paul:
Warren has such an interesting
relationship with his father,

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.788
who testified against him.

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:03.874
Stop talking to that woman.

00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:06.877
You leave it, or I can make your
life miserable in here.

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:09.379
Not if I killed you.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.091
Octavia Spencer:
Warren Cave makes you hate him.

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:14.426
He makes you love him.

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:16.428
Octavia Spencer:
And you're constantly
left wondering, 

00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:18.555
Octavia Spencer:
what side of the fence
is this guy playing?

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:21.475
(Music)

00:02:21.475 --> 00:02:23.101
Don't let my mother die
alone.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.814
(Music)

